d 'XTFLUCBREAK': module to perform a fluctuation test for a structural change at an unknown date in heterogeneous panel data models, with or without common correlated effects
d
d	xtflucbreak implements the fluctuation test of Li, Xiao and
d Chen (2024) for a structural change at an unknown date in the   
d heterogeneous panel regression	    y{sub:it} =
d x{sub:it}'({&beta}{sub:i} + {&delta}{sub:i}·1{t > k{sub:0}}) +
d e{sub:it},	 i = 1,...,N,  t = 1,...,T,    where every panel
d has its own slope vector {&beta}{sub:i}. The null is H{sub:0}:
d {&delta}{sub:i} = 0 for all i; the	alternative allows a break
d in a fraction c > 0 of the panels. 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: structural breaks
d KW: common correlated effects
d KW: fluctuation test
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f xtflucbreak.ado
f xtflucbreak.sthlp
f xtflucbreak_methods.sthlp
f xtflucbreak_postestimation.sthlp
f xtflucbreak_example.do
